Non-pregnant, non-lactating women of reproductive age

* Hemoglobin \ 38°C\], chills/shaking, dry cough, shortness of breath or difficulty breathing, loss of smell or taste within the past 72 hours) \[individual may repeat eligibility assessment after deferral\];
* Recent diarrhea \[≥3 liquid or semiliquid stools in 72 hours\]) \[individual may repeat eligibility assessment after deferral\];
